<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="theme-color" content="#635bdb"><title>StudySprint — Study smarter</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body><div class="app-shell">
<aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">✦</span><span>StudySprint</span></div><div class="side-label">WORKSPACE</div><nav id="sideNav"><button class="nav-item active" data-page="home">⌂ <span>Dashboard</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-page="subjects">▤ <span>My subjects</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-page="tasks">☷ <span>Task manager</span><b class="nav-count" id="taskCount">4</b></button><button class="nav-item" data-page="progress">◔ <span>Progress</span></button></nav><div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="tip-card"><div class="tip-icon">✧</div><strong>Small steps add up.</strong><p>Stay consistent and make every study session count.</p></div><div class="profile"><div class="avatar">NN</div><div><strong>Nikhil Nandha</strong><small>Student account</small></div><span class="dots">•••</span></div></div></aside>
<main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div class="mobile-brand"><span class="brand-mark">✦</span> StudySprint</div><div class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span> <b id="crumb">Dashboard</b></div><div class="top-actions"><span class="today" id="today"></span><button class="icon-btn" aria-label="Notifications">♧</button><div class="avatar small">NN</div></div></header>
<section id="page-home" class="page active"><div class="welcome-row"><div><div class="eyebrow">TUESDAY, YOUR DAY TO GROW</div><h1>Good afternoon, <span id="studentGreeting">Student</span> <span>✦</span></h1><p class="muted">Ready to make today count? Here's your study overview.</p></div><button class="primary" data-action="add-task">＋ Add a task</button></div>
<div class="hero"><div><div class="hero-tag">✦ YOUR DAILY FOCUS</div><h2>A little progress<br>each day adds up.</h2><p>You're building great habits. Keep your momentum going!</p><button class="hero-btn" data-page="tasks">View my tasks <span>→</span></button></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="sun"></div><div class="book book-one"></div><div class="book book-two"></div><div class="plant">✿</div><div class="art-caption">FOCUS<br>ON YOU</div></div></div>
<div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Your overview</h2><p class="muted">A snapshot of your learning journey</p></div><button class="text-btn" data-page="progress">View report →</button></div>
<div class="stats-grid"><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon purple">▤</span><span class="trend">↗ 2 this week</span></div><strong id="stat-subjects">4</strong><p>Active subjects</p></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon orange">☷</span><span class="trend">Keep going</span></div><strong id="stat-pending">4</strong><p>Pending tasks</p></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon green">✓</span><span class="trend">↗ Great work</span></div><strong id="stat-done">12</strong><p>Tasks completed</p></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon blue">◷</span><span class="trend">This week</span></div><strong>18.5h</strong><p>Study time</p></article></div>
<div class="content-grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Today's tasks</h3><p class="muted">Stay on top of your priorities</p></div><button class="text-btn" data-page="tasks">See all →</button></div><div id="homeTasks" class="task-list"></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Subject progress</h3><p class="muted">Your learning at a glance</p></div><button class="more-btn" data-page="subjects">•••</button></div><div id="homeSubjects" class="subject-progress"></div></section></div></section>
<section id="page-subjects" class="page"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR LEARNING SPACE</div><h1>My subjects</h1><p class="muted">Organise your courses and keep track of your learning.</p></div><button class="primary" id="addSubject">＋ Add subject</button></div><div class="subject-grid" id="subjectGrid"></div></section>
<section id="page-tasks" class="page"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">PLAN. FOCUS. FINISH.</div><h1>Task manager</h1><p class="muted">Every completed task is a step closer to your goal.</p></div><button class="primary" data-action="add-task">＋ New task</button></div><div class="task-toolbar"><div class="filter-tabs" id="filters"><button class="filter active" data-filter="all">All tasks</button><button class="filter" data-filter="pending">Pending</button><button class="filter" data-filter="done">Completed</button></div><span class="muted" id="taskSummary"></span></div><div class="panel task-panel"><div id="allTasks" class="task-list"></div></div></section>
<section id="page-progress" class="page"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR GROWTH, VISUALISED</div><h1>Progress tracker</h1><p class="muted">Celebrate how far you've come. Keep moving forward.</p></div><span class="date-pill">◷ This week</span></div><div class="progress-top"><div class="panel overall"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Overall completion</h3><p class="muted">Your task completion rate</p></div><span class="stat-icon green">↗</span></div><div class="ring-wrap"><div class="ring" id="progressRing"><div><strong id="completionPct">75%</strong><small>completed</small></div></div><div class="ring-legend"><p><i class="dot purple-dot"></i><b id="completedLegend">12</b> Completed</p><p><i class="dot gray-dot"></i><b id="pendingLegend">4</b> Remaining</p></div></div></div><div class="panel streak"><div class="streak-emoji">🔥</div><div class="eyebrow">CURRENT STREAK</div><strong>5 days</strong><p class="muted">You're on fire! Keep your learning streak alive.</p><div class="week-days"><span>M</span><span>T</span><span>W</span><span>T</span><span>F</span><span>S</span><span>S</span></div><div class="week-dots"><i>✓</i><i>✓</i><i>✓</i><i>✓</i><i>✓</i><i></i><i></i></div></div></div><div class="panel progress-subjects"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Progress by subject</h3><p class="muted">See where your effort is going</p></div></div><div id="progressSubjects"></div></div></section>
<section id="page-login" class="page login-page"><div class="login-card"><div class="brand centered"><span class="brand-mark">✦</span><span>StudySprint</span></div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR STUDY JOURNEY STARTS HERE</div><h1>Make every<br>study session count.</h1><p class="muted">Plan smarter, stay focused, and celebrate your progress.</p><form id="loginForm"><label for="studentName">Your name</label><input id="studentName" placeholder="Enter your name" value="Nikhil Nandha" required><label for="studentEmail">Email address</label><input id="studentEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required><button class="primary full">Continue to dashboard →</button></form><small class="muted">Demo experience · No account required</small></div></section>
</main><nav class="mobile-nav" id="mobileNav"><button class="active" data-page="home"><span>⌂</span>Home</button><button data-page="subjects"><span>▤</span>Subjects</button><button data-page="tasks"><span>☷</span>Tasks</button><button data-page="progress"><span>◔</span>Progress</button></nav></div>
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="taskModal"><form class="modal" id="taskForm"><div class="modal-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">MAKE IT HAPPEN</div><h2>Add a new task</h2></div><button type="button" class="close" data-close>×</button></div><label for="taskTitle">Task title</label><input id="taskTitle" placeholder="e.g. Revise chapter 3" maxlength="80" required aria-describedby="taskTitleError"><small class="field-error" id="taskTitleError" aria-live="polite"></small><label for="taskSubject">Subject</label><select id="taskSubject"></select><label for="taskDate">Due date</label><input id="taskDate" type="date" required aria-describedby="taskDateError"><small class="field-error" id="taskDateError" aria-live="polite"></small><small class="muted" id="noSubjectsHint" hidden>No subjects available. Add a subject first.</small><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary" data-close>Cancel</button><button class="primary" id="saveTaskButton">Save task</button></div></form></div>
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="subjectModal"><form class="modal" id="subjectForm"><div class="modal-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUILD YOUR WORKSPACE</div><h2>Add a subject</h2></div><button type="button" class="close" data-close>×</button></div><label for="subjectName">Subject name</label><input id="subjectName" placeholder="e.g. Computer Networks" maxlength="40" required aria-describedby="subjectNameError"><small class="field-error" id="subjectNameError" aria-live="polite"></small><label for="subjectColor">Choose a colour</label><select id="subjectColor"><option value="purple">Violet</option><option value="orange">Orange</option><option value="green">Green</option><option value="blue">Blue</option><option value="pink">Pink</option></select><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary" data-close>Cancel</button><button class="primary">Add subject</button></div></form></div><div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>
